262
00:19:47,700 --> 00:19:51,700
What are you thanking me for, weirdo?

263
00:19:51,700 --> 00:19:54,700
There's nothing wrong with your legs still, is there?

264
00:19:54,700 --> 00:19:55,700
Mm-mm.

265
00:19:55,700 --> 00:19:57,700
It's fine.

266
00:19:57,700 --> 00:19:59,700
It doesn't even hurt now.

267
00:19:59,700 --> 00:20:00,700
All good.

268
00:20:00,700 --> 00:20:03,700
Well, if you're sure.

269
00:20:03,700 --> 00:20:06,700
I just feel like something is off.

270
00:20:06,700 --> 00:20:09,700
I told you, everything is fine.

271
00:20:09,700 --> 00:20:13,700
Oh, but you being here alone is kind of weird, I guess.

272
00:20:13,700 --> 00:20:17,700
Uh, well, you know, your party mentioned you were missing, so...

273
00:20:17,700 --> 00:20:18,700
What?

274
00:20:18,700 --> 00:20:20,700
Are they all okay?

275
00:20:20,700 --> 00:20:23,700
Amir is dead.

276
00:20:23,700 --> 00:20:24,700
Amir is dead.

277
00:20:24,700 --> 00:20:25,700
Oh.

278
00:20:37,700 --> 00:20:39,700
You ready to head back to town?

279
00:20:39,700 --> 00:20:40,700
Mm-hmm.

280
00:20:50,700 --> 00:20:51,700
Listen!

281
00:20:51,700 --> 00:20:52,700
