282
00:20:55,700 --> 00:20:58,700
I'm really glad you came to rescue me.

283
00:21:01,700 --> 00:21:06,700
And just like that, something inside me clicked together.

284
00:21:06,700 --> 00:21:10,700
I feel like I've been forgiven for everything I've done and been.

285
00:21:10,700 --> 00:21:15,700
In a way, I sort of feel like Sarah just saved me.

286
00:21:19,700 --> 00:21:20,700
Suzanne!

287
00:21:20,700 --> 00:21:21,700
Sarah!

288
00:21:21,700 --> 00:21:22,700
You had me so worried.

289
00:21:22,700 --> 00:21:25,700
We were just setting out to go look for you again.

290
00:21:25,700 --> 00:21:26,700
It's okay.

291
00:21:26,700 --> 00:21:28,700
Rudeus rescued me.

292
00:21:28,700 --> 00:21:29,700
Did you...

293
00:21:29,700 --> 00:21:33,700
Did you set out by yourself after we told you what happened last night?

294
00:21:33,700 --> 00:21:34,700
Well, I...

295
00:21:34,700 --> 00:21:35,700
Yeah.

296
00:21:35,700 --> 00:21:37,700
Do you have any idea how reckless that was?

297
00:21:37,700 --> 00:21:39,700
