298
00:21:39,700 --> 00:21:40,700
Suzanne!

299
00:21:40,700 --> 00:21:41,700
You don't have to put it like that.

300
00:21:41,700 --> 00:21:42,700
Jeez!

301
00:21:43,700 --> 00:21:45,700
No, I suppose you're right about that.

302
00:21:45,700 --> 00:21:47,700
I'm not exactly myself right now.

303
00:21:48,700 --> 00:21:49,700
Rudeus?

304
00:21:49,700 --> 00:21:50,700
I apologize.

305
00:21:50,700 --> 00:21:53,700
I should have started by saying thank you for saving her.

306
00:21:53,700 --> 00:21:54,700
Sorry.

307
00:21:57,700 --> 00:21:58,700
Rudeus.

308
00:21:58,700 --> 00:21:59,700
I'm grateful.

309
00:21:59,700 --> 00:22:01,700
I mean that with all I am.

310
00:22:01,700 --> 00:22:08,700
If there's any way at all we can repay you, just name it.

311
00:22:08,700 --> 00:22:11,700
Please, you don't need to thank me.

312
00:22:11,700 --> 00:22:13,700
You've done so much to help me already.

313
00:22:13,700 --> 00:22:14,700
Honest.

314
00:22:14,700 --> 00:22:15,700
And I mean it too.

315
00:22:15,700 --> 00:22:18,700
Counter Arrow has been there for me since the second we stepped foot in this town.

316
00:22:18,700 --> 00:22:19,700
They don't owe me a thing.

317
00:22:19,700 --> 00:22:20,700
If you like, we can just say this makes us even, okay?

318
00:22:20,700 --> 00:22:21,700
Really?

319
00:22:21,700 --> 00:22:22,700
If you insist.

320
00:22:22,700 --> 00:22:23,700
But if you need us, we'll always be around.

321
00:22:23,700 --> 00:22:24,700
Okay.

322
00:22:24,700 --> 00:22:25,700
And hey, the same goes for you guys.

323
00:22:25,700 --> 00:22:32,700
I ought to go home.

324
00:22:32,700 --> 00:22:33,700
Okay, I'll walk you there.

325
00:22:33,700 --> 00:22:34,700
Rudeus!

326
00:22:34,700 --> 00:22:36,700
If you like, we can just say this makes us even, okay?

327
00:22:36,700 --> 00:22:37,700
Really?

328
00:22:37,700 --> 00:22:38,700
If you insist.

329
00:22:38,700 --> 00:22:39,700
But if you need us, we'll always be around.

330
00:22:39,700 --> 00:22:40,700
Okay.

331
00:22:40,700 --> 00:22:43,700
And hey, the same goes for you guys.

332
00:22:44,700 --> 00:22:46,700
I ought to go home.

333
00:22:46,700 --> 00:22:47,700
Okay.

334
00:22:47,700 --> 00:22:50,700
I'll walk you there.

335
00:22:51,700 --> 00:22:52,700
Rudeus!

336
00:22:52,700 --> 00:22:57,340
Rudeus, I'll see you later.

337
00:22:58,680 --> 00:23:00,500
Make sure you get some rest today.

338
00:23:14,100 --> 00:23:15,400
Time for a break.

339
00:23:16,020 --> 00:23:17,200
I think I earned it.

340
00:23:22,700 --> 00:23:32,340
I feel like I can sleep soundly for the first time in ages.

